やの胸のサイズは2018年現在でいうところのCカップ程度なので、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ブラジャーなしでもクーパー靱帯は切れておらず、美しいお椀型の美乳を維持している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"乳輪は小さめで色素が薄いことが、立ち姿から容易に想像できる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"61982"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"c","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19903","sourceWorkId":"26578","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a5/a5d99eb88d216146e59c3221a6324d6027ca5e79fc4689ac476c5d994de38b37.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cb/cb282a391e0f2573554ad5f2fbbcdd1440e61efb3144779324ef48e960dffdb2.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"浅川悠","creatorId":"vndb:s81","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s81","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s81","name":"浅川 悠","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:240016:61982:3958:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c68591","characterName":"薊野 椿姫","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"61984","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"240016"}],"egsCharacterIds":["19904"],"vndbCharacterId":"c68591"},"originalCharacterName":"薊野 椿姫","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"29"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"At 29 years old, Tsubaki is the youngest professor in Nariyama Academy. A bisexual ice queen."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She was the right-hand woman of Hazuki Izana for several years before the pigeons began eating radio waves. She firmly believes that Izana is the only person smarter than her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A heavy smoker, she carries with her a bitter, heartrending scent, and her kisses leave the distinct aftertaste of tobacco. Her cigarette brand of choice is the ever-popular π-lite, a traditional brand that has kept the same packaging for the last 100 years. Each cig contains 17mg of tar and 1.4mg of nicotine."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The way her small blue tank-top fits around her large chest attracts the gazes of men across all age ranges, but she pays them no mind. This dismissive demeanor of hers only serves to stir the hearts of men further."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From NekoNyan"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c68591"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"鳴山公空学園の最年少教授。２９才。バイセクシャル。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人工鳩が電波喰いを始める前の数年間、葉月伊耶那の右腕を務めていた。自分より頭のいい人間は葉月伊耶那ただ１人だと確信している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヘビースモーカーで、椿姫とのキスはタバコのflavorがする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"苦くて、切ない香り。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"愛煙の『π-lite（パイライト）』は１００年以上パッケージが変わっていない伝統的な銘柄で、タール17mg、ニコチン1.4mg。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大きいバストと青色のタンクトップの組み合わせは、２０６１年になっても当然のように全男子の視線を集めている。だが本人は全く気にしていない。そういう凛とした態度が、さらに男心をくすぐる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19904","sourceWorkId":"26578","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"CV：海野佳衣"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"鳴山公空学園の最年少教授。29才。バイセクシャル。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人工鳩が電波喰いを始める前の数年間、葉月伊耶那の右腕を務めていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分より頭のいい人間は葉月伊耶那ただ1人だと確信している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヘビースモーカーで、椿姫とのキスはタバコのflavorがする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"苦くて、切ない香り。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"愛煙の『π-lite（パイライト）』は100年以上パッケージが変わっていない伝統的な銘柄で、タール17mg、ニコチン1.4mg。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大きいバストと青色のタンクトップの組み合わせは、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"2061年になっても当然のように全男子の視線を集めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だが本人は全く気にしていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そういう凛とした態度が、さらに男心をくすぐる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"61984"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"年龄（本版本）","value":"29 岁","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19904","sourceWorkId":"26578","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandi